    <summary>Free real-time system monitoring sidebar for Windows</summary>
    <description>
Ultra System Monitor is a free real-time system monitoring sidebar for Windows by AiCMS.BD.

Per-core CPU load and temperature, GPU stats (NVIDIA/AMD/Intel), RAM, motherboard, network with live graphs, storage and security health. Detach any section as a floating widget with card or speedometer gauge view. 3D glassmorphism themes, custom accent colors, English + Bangla, desktop alerts, CSV/JSON export.

No ads. No tracking. No telemetry. Your data never leaves your machine.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/aicmsbd/ultra-system-monitor/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
